WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.580
- Two, that's a fun age sometimes.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.540
Terrible twos yet?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.920
- Not yet?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.910
Well-

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:06.840
- I didn't get terrible twos.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.400
I got three-nager.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.950
- That's what I'm scared
is that it's just delayed

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.690
and I keep saying she's perfect

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.790
and then she's gonna sneak up on me.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.730
She's super joyful.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.080
Meow was her first word,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.840
but her other word is no.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.090
She's a totally unreliable narrator.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.860
- She's just, "no."

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.120
She'll be eating watermelon

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.557
and I'll say, "Oh, is that watermelon?"

00:00:29.557 --> 00:00:30.390
"No."

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.470
(audience laughs)
- She's already

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.430
gaslighting her.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:34.736
She's already gaslighting her!

00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:35.569
- At young age.
- Kids are the-

00:00:35.569 --> 00:00:37.590
- She does it with the cutest voice.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.000
- That's gaslighting;
- (indistinct) it.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.220
So now 15 years from now,

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.513
she's been encouraged to
act like this by her mother.

00:00:43.513 --> 00:00:44.346
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:44.346 --> 00:00:45.179
- Oh. my gosh.

00:00:45.179 --> 00:00:46.920
I love, I miss-

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.753
I don't miss as I-

00:00:47.753 --> 00:00:48.586
I love every age.

00:00:48.586 --> 00:00:49.890
But mine are seven and nine at this point.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.940
And it's like you just-

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.960
I was out trick-or-treating with them

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:52.793
and seeing all

00:00:52.793 --> 00:00:53.626
these little kids
- I know.

00:00:53.626 --> 00:00:54.459
- Those little costumes.

00:00:54.459 --> 00:00:55.522
Aw.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.355
- It's very cozy.

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:57.188
- Very dangerous.

00:00:57.188 --> 00:00:58.021
(Barbara laughs)

00:00:58.021 --> 00:00:59.687
'cause I did not need more children.

00:00:59.687 --> 00:01:00.520
(audience laughs)

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.002
I was already a single mom, but-

00:01:02.002 --> 00:01:03.780
You have one boy and two girls, right?

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:04.613
- Yes.

00:01:04.613 --> 00:01:05.730
- Okay, so I have a boy and a girl.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:07.230
That's very different.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.190
Are you experiencing that?

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.023
- My gosh.

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:11.130
When Hal entered the equation,

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.380
it was like we didn't
even know what to do.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.940
It was like all this boy energy

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.010
that our house kind of needed

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.441
'cause it was a lot of girl things, vibes.

00:01:19.441 --> 00:01:21.870
- But boys are like tasmanian devils.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:22.703
- [Jenna] Oh, yeah.

00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:23.586
- Yeah.

00:01:23.586 --> 00:01:24.450
- No, he leads with his head.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.283
- Yeah.

00:01:25.283 --> 00:01:27.861
- He was also a New York
City rat for Halloween,

00:01:27.861 --> 00:01:28.694
(audience laughs)

00:01:28.694 --> 00:01:29.640
- Which is kind of awesome.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.473
- [Barbara] Which is awesome.

00:01:30.473 --> 00:01:32.340
- The foreshadowing of who he's gonna be

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.720
is pretty magical, right?

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:34.553
(all laugh)

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.550
It's like, "Alright. I love that."

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.080
- He's not afraid to be himself for sure.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.370
- Yeah, mine loves scary

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.380
and I think that's
insane. 'cause he's seven.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:41.580
But he was like, "Mom, take a picture."

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.740
Everything just horribly scary.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.180
He was like, "Take a picture, take video."

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.112
I was like, "Why?"

00:01:46.112 --> 00:01:47.940
- So we can watch this?
So we can look back over.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.112
- That was like later, yeah.

00:01:49.112 --> 00:01:50.613
But he loves it.

